<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Sporitelna announces board changes.</title>
<headline>Czech Sporitelna announces board changes.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech savings bank Ceska Sporitelna a.s. said on Wednesday that its deputy general director and board member Frantisek Kopriva had resigned to take a position with Midland Bank Czech Republic, part of HSBC Holdings.</p>
<p>In a statement, it said that Kamil Ziegler, who has served in various leadership positions with the commercial bank Komercni Banka a.s., would join Sporitelna's board of directors beginning on February 1, 1997.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
